  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Primary button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Crimson action for importing and confirming a dataset.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4M17 8l-5-5-5 5M12 3v12\"/></svg>Import dataset</button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;min-height:40px;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:6px;font-family:\"DM Sans\",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:550;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;touch-action:manipulation;transition:background-color 140ms,border-color 140ms}.ds-primary:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed}.ds-primary:active:not(:disabled){transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#f292a4);outline-offset:4px}@media(pointer:coarse){.ds-primary{min-height:44px;}}.ds-primary{background:var(--accent,#b72e48);color:var(--on-accent,#fff8f5)}@media(hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){.ds-primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--accent-hover,#ca3653)}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-primary{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Secondary button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "Bordered charcoal action for supporting workflow choices.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-secondary\">Download CSV template</button>",
      "css": ".ds-secondary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;min-height:40px;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:6px;font-family:\"DM Sans\",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:550;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;touch-action:manipulation;transition:background-color 140ms,border-color 140ms}.ds-secondary:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed}.ds-secondary:active:not(:disabled){transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-secondary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#f292a4);outline-offset:4px}@media(pointer:coarse){.ds-secondary{min-height:44px;}}.ds-secondary{background:var(--surface-raised,#222126);color:var(--ink,#f2ede7);border-color:var(--control-line,#6c6570)}@media(hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){.ds-secondary:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--surface-hover,#2c292f);border-color:var(--muted,#b3adb0)}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-secondary{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-text",
      "description": "Quiet rose action for supplementary workflow links.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-text-action\">Download an error example</button>",
      "css": ".ds-text-action{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:5px 0;border:0;background:none;color:var(--accent-text,#f292a4);font-family:\"DM Sans\",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none}@media(hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){.ds-text-action:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}}.ds-text-action:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#f292a4);outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Search field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input-search",
      "description": "Constrained desktop search that fills its toolbar on mobile.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-search\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"/></svg><input aria-label=\"Search aircraft\" placeholder=\"Search aircraft\" /></label>",
      "css": ".ds-search{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;width:300px;max-width:100%;min-width:0;padding:0 10px;background:var(--surface,#17171b);border:1px solid var(--control-line,#6c6570);border-radius:6px;color:var(--muted,#b3adb0)}.ds-search input{min-width:0;width:100%;height:38px;padding:1px 2px;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#f2ede7);caret-color:var(--accent-text,#f292a4);font-family:\"DM Sans\",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;font-size:12px}.ds-search input::placeholder{color:var(--muted,#b3adb0)}.ds-search input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#f292a4);outline-offset:1px}@media(max-width:640px){.ds-search{width:100%}}@media(pointer:coarse){.ds-search input{font-size:16px;height:44px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sidebar navigation item",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-active",
      "description": "Selected view with a soft crimson fill and rose icon.",
      "html": "<nav aria-label=\"Workspace\"><button class=\"ds-nav-item\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17.8 19.2 16 11l3.5-3.5C21 6 21.5 4 21 3c-1-.5-3 0-4.5 1.5L13 8 4.8 6.2c-.5-.1-.9.1-1.1.5l-.3.5c-.2.5-.1 1 .3 1.3L9 12l-2 3H4l-1 1 3 2 2 3 1-1v-3l3-2 3.5 5.3c.3.4.8.5 1.3.3l.5-.2c.4-.3.6-.7.5-1.2z\"/></svg>Aircraft register</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;width:100%;min-height:44px;padding:10px 14px;background:transparent;border:0;border-radius:7px;color:var(--muted,#b3adb0);font-family:\"DM Sans\",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms,color 150ms}.ds-nav-item[aria-current=page]{background:var(--accent-soft,#391c27);color:var(--ink,#f2ede7)}.ds-nav-item[aria-current=page] svg{color:var(--accent-text,#f292a4)}@media(hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){.ds-nav-item:hover:not([aria-current=page]){background:var(--surface-raised,#222126);color:var(--ink,#f2ede7)}}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#f292a4);outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav-item{transition:none}}@media(max-width:850px){.ds-nav-item{font-size:11px;padding:10px;gap:9px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Reported status tag",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "tag-available",
      "description": "Source-reported availability; separate from freshness.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-status\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Reported available</span>",
      "css": ".ds-status{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:5px 7px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--success-soft,#172b24);color:var(--success,#87c5a6);font-family:\"DM Sans\",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.2;white-space:nowrap}.ds-status>span{width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Import work panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel-import",
      "description": "Flat bordered container for the import workflow.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-import-panel\"><h2>Review your import</h2><p>Check the details before anything changes in your register.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-import-panel{min-width:0;padding:25px;background:var(--surface,#17171b);border:1px solid var(--line,#363239);border-radius:10px;color:var(--ink,#f2ede7);font-family:\"DM Sans\",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}.ds-import-panel h2{margin:0;font-size:18px;font-weight:550;letter-spacing:-.3px}.ds-import-panel p{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted,#b3adb0)}@media(max-width:1180px){.ds-import-panel{padding:20px}}@media(max-width:640px){.ds-import-panel{padding:17px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Source first.",
    "overview": "SAMPATI · सम्पाति pairs a quiet black-and-charcoal workspace with crimson actions, warm ivory text and restrained saffron. The approved descriptor is “Air Operations & Resource Decision Support”. A folk-style soaring-bird emblem, Yatra One display lettering and an approved crimson/ivory/gold panorama express the identity in the header; the interface stays focused on scanning reports and completing an import.\n\nThis documents the implemented local, fictional aircraft-report prototype. The descriptor names the broader project and does not imply that future operations, live feeds or AI capabilities exist. This approved theme supersedes the provisional Airframe name, ink-blue navigation and white reading surfaces; the table, sidebar, import workflow and source-first principles remain.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Task-focused hierarchy and compact, structured data.",
      "Bilingual bird identity and an illustrated header with restrained gold.",
      "Tonal surfaces, clear borders and visible keyboard focus.",
      "Reported status and report freshness shown separately."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Identity Accent Rule",
        "body": "Reserve saffron for identity and the approved artwork; use crimson for actions and the semantic families for data states.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Reading Hierarchy Rule",
        "body": "Keep instructions and decisions at the established reading scale; do not borrow tiny metadata styles for essential content.",
        "section": "typography"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do keep scanning, source context and import completion ahead of decoration.",
      "Do preserve the bilingual wordmark and the approved descriptor.",
      "Do use text as well as color for status, freshness and validation.",
      "Do keep keyboard focus visible and honor reduced motion.",
      "Do label fictional local data honestly and preview changes before confirmation."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't use saffron as a general action, status or chart color.",
      "Don't collapse reported status and freshness into one signal.",
      "Don't add decorative entrance motion to this workflow.",
      "Don't turn tiny metadata sizes into a target for new reading content.",
      "Don't imply live tracking, AI decisions, flight authorization or airworthiness certification."
    ]
  }
}
